      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NIGHT LIGHTER (4) is a classy pup building a strong winning record at the journey. Has quickly put himself into the picture to win the last couple of runs. Latest win recorded a handy 15.79 at Cannington. Winner at his latest appearance in the quickest time on the card. Well placed and will be tough to beat. CERULEAN POPPY (1) charged out of the boxes with a fast early split and led for much of the way before being grabbed late, finishing a 0.8 lengths third at this track over 400m in 22.52. Form from her last run is proving to be solid. Expected to be in this for a long way. FEARLESS PARKER (2) was prominent early from the tricky draw and did a fair job to be beaten 5 lengths into third (21.96) at Cannington in a Free For All over 381m. Hard to beat again. GOES BANG (7) with some luck can improve on an unplaced run last time here.",
